Feature: kato basic

  Scenario: root help lists the Git command group
    When I run "kato --help"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output contains "git"
    And output does not contain "  branch"
    And output does not contain "  log"

  Scenario: Git help lists Git workflow commands
    When I run "kato git --help"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output contains "branch"
    And output contains "log"

  Scenario: branch help describes the command
    When I run "kato git branch --help"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output contains "branch"

  Scenario: branch in non-git directory fails
    When I run "kato git branch"
    Then exit code is not 0
    And stderr contains "listing branches"

  Scenario: log help describes the command
    When I run "kato git log --help"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output contains "log"

  Scenario: log in non-git directory fails
    When I run "kato git log"
    Then exit code is not 0
    And stderr contains "building log"
